{"id":"n16595-1-8","stage":0,"title":"생신 · 寿辰","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16595-1-8-1","ko":"어머니의 생신 선물로 뭐가 좋을까?","zh":"买什么礼物送给妈妈的生日比较好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생신","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"好，吉","explanation":"좋다：好，吉；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"9","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，吉","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"日子或机会等正合适。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f075f0c26d618373859c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16595-1-8-2","ko":"내 생각에는 화장품이 좋을 것 같은데.","zh":"我觉得化妆品应该会很合适。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각에는","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장품이","meaning":"化妆品","explanation":"화장품：化妆品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73232","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을","meaning":"好，吉","explanation":"좋다：好，吉；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"9","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1